# Google API credentials -- never commit these.
# Patterns are deliberately broad: Google's download name is
# client_secret_<id>.apps.googleusercontent.com.json, which a narrower glob
# silently fails to match, leaving the secret staged by `git add -A`.
credentials.json
token.json
client_secret*
*client_secret*
*apps.googleusercontent.com.json
*.pem
.env

# personal test inputs -- never publish
my_samples/
